4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F128469%2F128469.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs md:text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n      ✈️ 白川温泉　華匠庵＜熊本県＞ の最新空室状況・限定お得プランを見る（楽天トラベル公式）\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4 gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">黒川温泉　歴史の宿　御客屋</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.91（473件）</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-red-50 text-red-700 font-bold text-xs rounded-full border border-red-200\">目安 ¥15,400〜</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/80591/80591.jpg\" alt=\"黒川温泉　歴史の宿　御客屋\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 創業 300 年【半農半宿】の宿。自家農園で育てた食材、地元生産者から仕入れた食材を使った料理が自慢</p>\n      <p><strong>【所在地・エリア】</strong> 📍 熊本県阿蘇郡南小国町満願寺黒川温泉6546</p>\n      <p><strong>【交通アクセス】</strong> 🚃 九州道熊本ＩＣより車で90分、大分道日田ＩＣより車で60分、ＪＲ阿蘇駅よりバスで50分（車で40分）</p>\n      <p><strong>【黒川温泉　歴史の宿　御客屋の滞在ポイント】</strong> 熊本県の観光拠点として動きやすく、チェックイン後の入浴から翌